  "ruleText": "He-W 837.13 Extra Hours. A beneficiary shall not be permitted to carry-over hours in excess of the 100-hour requirement in order to satisfy the community engagement requirement.\n\nSource. #12733, INTERIM, eff 2-23-19, EXPIRES: 8-22-19; ss by #12796, eff 6-5-19 (formerly He-W 837.14)",
